7,{"$type":".General.Code, LuaSTGEditorSharp","Attributes":[{"attrCap":"Code","attrInput":"self.txt = {\r\n\r\n\t\"Trailing Snake\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"\\n\" .. \"Omikuji Dice\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"\\n\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"Frog Spread\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"\\n\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"Tornado Repelling\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"\\n\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"Reawakening Miracle\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"\\n\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"Ocean Nexus\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"\\n\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"Reverse Amulet\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\r\n}\r\nself.img_list = {\r\n\t\"image:Trailing_Snake\",\r\n\t\"image:Omikuji_Dice\",\r\n\t\"image:Frog_Spread\",\r\n\t\"image:Tornado_Repelling\",\r\n\t\"image:Reawekening_Miracle\",\r\n\t\"image:Ocean_Nexus\",\r\n\t\"image:Reverse_Amulet\",\r\n}\r\nself.txt_price = {\r\n\r\n\t\"Price: xx MP\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"Price: xx MP\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"Price: 30 MP\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"Price: 40 MP\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"Price: 30 MP\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"Price: 30 MP\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"Price: 30 MP\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\r\n}\r\nself.txt_price_n = {\r\n\r\n\t99,\r\n\t99,\r\n\t30,\r\n\t40,\r\n\t30,\r\n\t30,\r\n\t30,\r\n\r\n}\r\nself.txt_type = {\r\n\r\n\t\"Type: Passive\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"Type: Active\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"Type: Passive\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"Type: Active\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"Type: Passive\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"Type: Active\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\"Type: Passive\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\r\n}\r\nself.txt_desc = {\r\n\r\n\t\"A casually default and handy power of Sanae. With this magical, effervescent, trailing snake,\" .. \"\\n\" ..\r\n\t\"no enemy will miss its path and a nasty bite will surely occur.\" .. \"\\n\" ..\r\n\t\"That is, as long as you are below said enemy. Weak, but gives you a nice cover area.\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\r\n\t\"An unstable piece of miracle. With the miraculous powers of Sanae Kochiya, spawning an omikuji\" .. \"\\n\" .. \r\n\t\"will surely bring you fathom to its outcome - will it be satisfying, or will it be... disastrous?\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\r\n\t\"As the usual cobalt spread, these cute frogs will give a nice area damage at a decent firing rate.\" .. \"\\n\" .. \r\n\t\"Very casual, so you can just equip this and focus on your dodging.\" .. \"\\n\" .. \r\n\t\"Useful for attacks where a lot of enemies are present.\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\r\n\t\"With a heavy but quick strong gush of wind, Sanae is able to perfectly erase all the obstacles\" .. \"\\n\" ..\r\n\t\"in front of her. With a skill this strong though, the added consequence is an annoying shaking\" .. \"\\n\" .. \r\n\t\"of her grounds. How will you handle this windy beast?\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\r\n\t\"By the power of gods, Sanae will not instantly die when hit. By channeling this otherworldly power,\" .. \"\\n\" .. \r\n\t\"a reawakening miracle will occur and she will be brought back to life.\" .. \"\\n\" ..\r\n\t\"Just give her some time to recompose herself.\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\r\n\t\"Waves of magic originate from a placed source. This nexus will then spawn a myriad of waves that\" .. \"\\n\" .. \r\n\t\"deal damage to enemies. They pierce, so it's nice to get them really high and let them deal damage\" .. \"\\n\" .. \r\n\t\"to the enemies. Because of their lack of stability, they rebel against you once they're done and\" .. \"\\n\" .. \r\n\t\"shoot water bullets at you.\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\r\n\t\"As her duty as a Shrine Maiden still persists, sometimes she just can't let go of her glorious amulets.\" .. \"\\n\" .. \r\n\t\"These square helpers will aid her to aim in another direction she usually doesn't look at - her back!\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\r\n}\r\nself.txt_use = {\r\n\r\n\t\"As a passive item, it will be active at all times. Snakes will come out of a Sanae option and will\" .. \"\\n\" ..\r\n\t\"travel upwards until it encounters a valid enemy, which then it will curve towards them and deal\" .. \"\\n\" ..\r\n\t\"low damage. Useful for attacks where you move a lot.\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\r\n\t\"You have 3 available omikuji once the scene starts. Press X to discharge the omikuji.\" .. \"\\n\" .. \r\n\t\"Three things can happen at random: You give heavy damage to the boss, you turn the boss invincible\" .. \"\\n\" .. \r\n\t\"for a few seconds, or it clears bullets.\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\r\n\t\"Two options will be present and they'll fire angled frogs. These bounce around the walls,\" .. \"\\n\" .. \r\n\t\"so don't worry a lot about them missing the target. Deals moderate damage.\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\r\n\t\"You have 2 available uses of this item once the scene starts. Press X to discharge the tornado,\" .. \"\\n\" .. \r\n\t\"which will make its path in front of Sanae deleting the bullets it comes in contact with.\" .. \"\\n\" .. \r\n\t\"It's narrow, but can help you escape tricky situations. The screen keeps shaking for a while once\" .. \"\\n\" ..\r\n\t\"it's fired, though.\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\r\n\t\"This item only allows you to be hit once to then resurrect you, and when brought back to life,\" .. \"\\n\" .. \r\n\t\"Sanae needs a recovery period before shooting again.\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\r\n\t\"You have infinite available uses of this item once the scene starts. The waves last for a given\" .. \"\\n\" ..\r\n\t\"amount of time dealing damage to the enemy, and once they're over, you can place this nexus again.\" .. \"\\n\" ..\r\n\t\"Watch out for water bullets whenever they're done firing, because they will kill you.\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\t\r\n\t\"As a passive item, it will be active at all times. Amulets will come out of a Sanae option behind her\" .. \"\\n\" ..\r\n\t\"and will travel downwards. Useful for attacks that you stay a long time at the top.\" .. \"\\n\",\r\n\r\n}\r\nself.txt2 = \"Trailing Snake\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"Omikuji Dice\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"Frog Spread\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"Tornado Repelling\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"Reawakening Miracle\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"Ocean Nexus\" .. \"\\n\" .. \"Reverse Amulet\" .. \"\\n\"\r\nself.opt = 1","EditWindow":"code"}],"IsExpanded":false,"AttributeCount":1}
